### Create User (direkt via H2-Konsole oder später via UserController)
### Vorher manuell in H2: INSERT INTO USERS (USERNAME, EMAIL, PASSWORD_HASH) VALUES ('demo', 'demo@mix.tape', 'hash123')

### Create Mixtape
POST http://localhost:8080/api/mixtapes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Summer Vibes 94",
  "description": "Hits vom Sommer",
  "cassetteType": "C90",
  "designTemplate": "retro",
  "labelColor": "#FF6B35",
  "isPublic": true,
  "userId": 1
}

### Get all public
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mixtapes

### Get by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/mixtapes/1

### Update
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/mixtapes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Summer Vibes 94 (Updated)",
  "description": "Noch mehr Hits",
  "cassetteType": "C90",
  "isPublic": true,
  "userId": 1
}

### Lock Mixtape
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/mixtapes/1/lock

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/mixtapes/1